            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Failure by any firm to pay all delinquent accounts in full by the 16th of the month following the month in which the funds were due shall result in a 72 hour notice by the business agent. The bargaining employees will be removed from all work and no further referrals will be made until all accounts are paid in full.",
